## 🔔 Notifications & Alerts

| Event | Who notified | Channel |
|-------|-------------|---------|
| Task assigned to me | Operator | 🔔 In-app + 📧 Email |
| My task is BLOCKED | Manager | 🔔 In-app + 📧 Email |
| Task overdue (past startTime) | Manager + Operator | 🔔 In-app |
| Astreinte week starts | On-call person | 🔔 In-app + 📧 Email (Sunday night) |
| Week not covered (no astreinte) | Manager | 🔔 In-app warning |
| New incident declared | On-call person | 🔔 In-app (urgent) |

---

## 🔌 Complete API Design

### Astreinte endpoints
| Method | Path | Who |
|--------|------|-----|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/astreintes/current` | Anyone — shows current on-call |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/astreintes?year=2026&teamId=...` | Manager |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/astreintes` | Manager — assign a week |
| `PATCH` | `/api/v1/astreintes/:id` | Manager — replace person |
| `DELETE` | `/api/v1/astreintes/:id` | Manager |

### Daily Plan endpoints
| Method | Path | Who |
|--------|------|-----|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/plans?date=2026-04-21&teamId=...` | Manager — day view |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/plans/week?weekStart=2026-04-21` | Manager — week view |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/plans` | Manager — create day plan |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/plans/:id` | Manager — plan detail |

### Operational Task endpoints
| Method | Path | Who |
|--------|------|-----|
| `POST` | `/api/v1/plans/:planId/tasks` | Manager — assign task |
| `PATCH` | `/api/v1/tasks/:id` | Manager — edit task |
| `DELETE` | `/api/v1/tasks/:id` | Manager |
| `PATCH` | `/api/v1/tasks/:id/status` | **Operator** — update status |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/me/tasks/today` | **Operator** — my tasks today |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/me/tasks/week` | **Operator** — my week |

---

## 🗄️ Final Data Model Summary

```
User ──────────────────┐
  │                    │
  │ (assigned to)      │ (creates)
  ▼                    ▼
OperationalTask ←── DailyPlan ──→ Team
  │
  ├── systemId → System
  ├── chainLabel (free text)
  ├── taskType (MEP, SUPERVISION, REPRISE_INCIDENT...)
  ├── startTime / endTime
  └── status (TODO / IN_PROGRESS / DONE / BLOCKED)

User ──────────────────┐
  │ (on astreinte)     │ (creates)
  ▼                    ▼
Astreinte ──────────→ Team  (one per week per team)
  └── weekNumber, year, startDate, endDate, phone
```

---

## 📦 Implementation Phases

### Phase 1 — Astreinte Module (Backend) ⏱️ 1 day
- [ ] Prisma: `Astreinte` model + migration
- [ ] `src/modules/astreinte/` — CRUD + `GET /current`
- [ ] Notification: email to person when astreinte week starts (Sunday evening cron)
- [ ] Notification: alert manager for uncovered weeks

### Phase 2 — Daily Plan + Tasks (Backend) ⏱️ 1.5 days
- [ ] Prisma: `DailyPlan`, `OperationalTask`, enums + migration
- [ ] `src/modules/daily-plan/` — CRUD for plans + tasks
- [ ] `GET /me/tasks/today` and `GET /me/tasks/week` endpoints
- [ ] `PATCH /tasks/:id/status` — operator status update + notification trigger

### Phase 3 — Frontend: Manager Views ⏱️ 2 days
- [ ] `src/features/equipe/` — new feature folder
- [ ] Astreinte yearly calendar page
- [ ] Daily task board (columns per person)
- [ ] Weekly view grid (person × day)
- [ ] Task assignment modal (pick person, type, system, time)

### Phase 4 — Frontend: Operator View ⏱️ 1 day
- [ ] "Mes Tâches" page (today + this week)
- [ ] Astreinte banner (who is on call this week)
- [ ] Status update buttons + note input
- [ ] Blocked flag with reason

### Phase 5 — Polish ⏱️ 0.5 day
- [ ] Dashboard widget: astreinte this week + today's tasks summary
- [ ] Export weekly plan as PDF / Excel

**Total estimate: ~6 days**

---

## ✅ What Already Exists — No Rebuild Needed

| Existing | Used for |
|----------|----------|
| `Team` + `TeamMember` | Plans scoped to team; assignees = team members |
| `System` | Tasks linked to existing monitored servers |
| `User` + `Role` | Manager role gates plan creation; operators see own tasks |
| `Notification` model | Reuse for task-assigned, blocked, astreinte-start events |
| `AuditLog` | All status changes auto-audited |
| `Incident` | Astreinte person auto-linked when an incident is declared |
